percent increase in volume is:\n\\[ \\frac{0.331V}{V} \\times 100\\% = 0.331 \\times 100\\% = 33.1\\% \\]\n\nRounding 33.1% to the nearest whole number, we get:\n\\[ \\boxed{33} \\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{33}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"geometry:293"}
